          "title": "You'll want to know: बहस",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बहस — bahas — \"an argument, a debate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कल रात अरुण और मीरा में लंबी बहस हुई। kal rāt Aruṇ aur Mīrā meṁ lambī bahas huī. Last night Arun and Mira had a long argument."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बहस (bahas) is usually traced to Arabic baḥth, \"an inquiry, a discussion\", which reached Hindi through Persian."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
